                                                "sense_id": "22130761-3396-3359-af7b-2b5b402517bc",
                                                "text": "Conwoman Jeanne de La Motte stole a 2,800-carat diamond necklace, The Slave's Collar, by convincing the Cardinal de Rohan that Queen Marie-Antoinette wanted it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7c580eb-1d32-439b-b92a-8a985769a67e",
                                                "sense_id": "22130761-3396-3359-af7b-2b5b402517bc",
                                                "text": "When Prosper Mérimée had next seen Mercedes after Spain, in March 1846, he told the Countess de Montijo that Mercedes \"looked less well preserved [and] limped a little.\""
